34037 0 obj
  << /ActualText (\324 c\257m \021i\307n th\364ng minh FPT Smart Home \055 PAWR027 l\340 m\331t ph\345 ki\307n trung gian\054 mang \021\277n ngu\323n n\003ng l\260\343ng hi\307u qu\243 cho c\341c thi\277t b\313 gia \021\354nh nh\260 qu\241t\054 \021\350n\054 s\241c v\340 \245m \021un\056 Nh\335 t\355ch h\343p kh\243 n\003ng k\277t n\321i Wi\055Fi v\340 Bluetooth\054 s\243n ph\251m n\340y cho ph\351p ng\260\335i d\371ng d\305 d\340ng \021i\301u khi\303n t\353 xa v\340 h\271n gi\335 ho\241t \021\331ng th\364ng qua \351ng d\345ng tr\352n \021i\307n tho\241i di \021\331ng\056 \020\342y s\275 l\340 l\361a ch\315n l\375 t\260\337ng cho nh\357ng ai \021ang t\354m ki\277m gi\243i ph\341p n\342ng cao ch\245t l\260\343ng cu\331c s\321ng v\340 t\321i \260u h\363a qu\243n l\375 n\003ng l\260\343ng trong gia \021\354nh\056\n\nT\260\241ng th\355ch ho\340n h\243o v\333i b\245t k\363 ph\355ch c\257m n\340o\n\324 c\257m th\364ng minh FPT Smart Home \055 PAWR027 c\363 thi\277t k\277 theo d\241ng h\354nh tr\345 tr\362n v\364 c\371ng tinh t\277 v\340 hi\307n \021\241i\056 V\317 ngo\340i m\340u tr\257ng kh\364ng nh\357ng mang l\241i v\273 sang tr\315ng m\340 c\362n h\340i h\362a v\333i kh\364ng gian v\340 c\341c thi\277t b\313 trong nh\340\056\n\nPh\247n ch\245u v\340 l\327 c\257m \021\260\343c gia c\364ng t\311 m\311 v\340 ch\257c ch\257n \021\303 t\260\241ng th\355ch ho\340n h\243o v\333i h\247u h\277t c\341c lo\241i ph\355ch c\257m kh\341c nhau\054 nh\260 d\271t\054 tr\362n\054 2 ch\342n v\340 3 ch\342n c\347a b\245t k\363 h\343ng n\340o tr\352n th\277 gi\333i\056\n\nV\333i d\362ng \021i\307n t\321i \021a 16A v\340 c\364ng su\245t l\352n \021\277n 3000W\054 ph\345 ki\307n n\340y c\363 kh\243 n\003ng cung c\245p n\003ng l\260\343ng cho h\247u h\277t c\341c thi\277t b\313 \021i\307n t\355 trong nh\340\056 Ch\245t li\307u nh\361a ABS v\353a gi\372p t\003ng c\260\335ng \021\331 b\301n v\353a ch\321ng ch\341y v\340 ch\313u t\243i t\321t d\371 cho s\355 d\345ng trong th\335i gian d\340i\056v\333i nhi\301u phong c\341ch kh\364ng gian kh\341c nhau\056\n\nB\331 x\355 l\375 AI Q4 n\342ng t\247m ch\245t l\260\343ng h\354nh \243nh v\340 \342m thanh\nB\331 x\355 l\375 AI Q4 l\340 \034tr\341i tim\035 c\347a Samsung Smart TV QLED 65 inch 4K QA65QEF1A\056 Nh\335 s\361 tr\343 gi\372p c\347a AI\054 b\331 x\355 l\375 c\363 kh\243 n\003ng ph\342n t\355ch v\340 tinh ch\311nh t\353ng khung h\354nh cing nh\260 \342m thanh theo th\335i gian th\361c\056 Qua \021\363\054 m\315i n\331i dung \021\301u \021\260\343c n\342ng c\245p l\352n g\247n chu\251n 4K v\333i \021\331 s\257c n\351t cao v\340 \342m thanh s\321ng \021\331ng\054 mang \021\277n cho ng\260\335i xem nh\357ng ph\372t gi\342y th\260\337ng th\351c m\343n nh\343n\056)
